damaging our national security.

00:03:21.639 --> 00:03:25.239
They're suggesting that Republicans defend
Trump.

00:03:25.239 --> 00:03:26.470
This is a talking point.

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:32.950
They workshopped presumably suggesting that
we defend that they defend Donald Trump by

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:35.129
blaming the deep state.

00:03:35.129 --> 00:03:40.879
You know, your talking points are really weak
when you have to raise the deep state conspiracy

00:03:40.879 --> 00:03:44.830
to show that everything Donald Trump did is
okay.

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:50.680
And then of course, Jay, maybe just as importantly
